'''Shachiko''' (シャチコ, ''Shachiko'') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[Dolphina]] that appears in [[Zero Legends]]. It was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shachiko
|image = E 715.png
|first appearance = '''ZL:''' [[Bamboocopter Launch|Sub-chapter 18 - Bamboocopter Launch]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL:''' [[Waterweed Trumpet|Sub-chapter 18 - Waterweed Trumpet]]
|money drop = 900¢ - 3,555¢
}}

==Enemy==
Shachiko behaves much like [[Dolphina]], albeit with different ranges (stands at 190, hits at 250~550), a guaranteed 6-second curse and all the debuff resistances that come with being a [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]]. Its base damage isn't particularly high, at only 12k compared to a 200% Dolphina's 15k.

==Strategy==
Similarly to Dolphina, minimize how many times Shachiko can survive by dealing high damage in one hit, or alternatively, abuse its high knockback count to juggle it with frequent and high enough damage to prevent it from even doing anything. [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] in particular is incredibly effective, stacking the damage multipliers of Insane Damage vs. Relic and Sage Slayer to kill Shachiko in just two hits at level 50. To minimize wasted attacks, a good strategy is to lure Shachiko to your base and then use Idi:NX to blow it up with ease.

